<title>CANADA: Canadian dollar ends little changed in quiet trade.</title>
<headline>Canadian dollar ends little changed in quiet trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>FORECAST RANGE   1.3800/1.3890	   ASIAN CLOSE     1.3850</p>
<p>RESISTANCE 1.3740   SUPPORT 1.3890     HI 1.3872   LO  1.3846</p>
<p>CANADA OPEN  1.3847/52    HI 1.3885    EUROPE OPEN     1.3852</p>
<p>PREV CLOSE   1.3843/48    LO 1.3846    HI 1.3854   LO  1.3752</p>
<p>---------------------MARKET COMMENT--------------------------</p>
<p>* Canada's dollar ended the session at C$1.3850 (US$0.7220) on Monday, little changed from the close on Friday. * Dealer activity was very light and the unit was expected to trade in a narrow range overnight. * Analysts said pressure mounted in the currency markets for another Bank of Canada interest rate hike.</p>
